        rdfs:comment      "This predicate relates a substance and a HumanAgent who is responsible for it.  Responsibility is understoond relatively broadly, and includes people or organizations responsible for the substance's discovery or marketing and manufacturing.  Additionally, agents that own the rights to the substance are also eligible to participate in this relationship.  Note that the humanAgent category include organizations, including universities, companies, and government agencies."@en ;
