        a                 owl:IrreflexiveProperty , owl:AsymmetricProperty , owl:ObjectProperty , rdf:Property , rdfs:Class ;
        rdfs:comment      "relates a substance to a condition that it might treat. This relation includes conditions that the substance has been designed or approved to treat, as well as conditions for which it is being investigated as a possible treatment.  Common folk remedies would also be eligible for this relation.  For example, it would be reasonable to say that \"chicken noodle soup\" is a possible treatment for \"colds\"."@en ;
